    {
      "type": "data-answer",
      "data": {
        "chainId": "revenueD2C:2026-10-08",
        "narrative": "Revenue is down about 6% over the last 14 days, and all of it is D2C, which is down 13%. Wholesale held flat.\n\nThe likely cause began on 26 Sep, the day of the event \"Diwali Early campaign paused\". Ad spend fell 8%, sessions fell 5% the same day, and D2C orders fell 13% from 28 Sep. Each of those moved in the order the graph expects, and the cause moved first.\n\nA second cause is also contributing. Landing-page conversion fell 26% from 28 Sep, the day of the event \"Shopify theme updated\", so the sessions that still arrive convert worse than before. Restoring the ad spend alone would send more traffic into a page that converts worse. Fix the landing page first, then the spend.",
        "citations": [
          "meta-ads:event:ev-campaign-paused",
